Changes to songbird 0.6.1 from crates.io, for ssspam. Bazel applies them (the monorepo's
MODULE.bazel, crate.annotation); cargo does not, so a cargo build has upstream songbird.

- Mixed audio is soft-clipped by a softplus curve and then hard-clipped at Config::clip_threshold,
  instead of upstream's softclip.
- Live::add_task: a mixer parked after its activation time no longer stops the RTP timestamp.

